Article 4 (Relationship to other statutes)
A citation of the former Enforcement Decree of the Urban Railroad Act or any provision thereof in other statutes as at the time this Decree enters into force shall be deemed a citation of this Decree or the relevant provision of this Decree, in lieu of the former provision, if corresponding provision exists herein.

